[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鍛錬そっちのけになるような楽しいこと……\nうーん、何があるかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something so fun that training falls by the wayside... hmm, what could that be?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この島には色んな遊具とか施設があるけど、\nどうせならアタシたちだけの特別なことがいいなぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's all kinds of rides and facilities on this island, but if we're doing something, I want it to be something special—just for us..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……姉様、目的の場所についたわ。\nここなら釣りが許可されている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...We're here. Fishing is permitted in this spot."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし！\u3000釣りしながら考えて、夜ご飯の食材調達して、\n時間を有効活用しやしょうや！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright! We can brainstorm while we fish and gather ingredients for dinner—killing two birds with one stone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いい魚が獲れたら、それでごちそうとか作っちゃう？\n美味しいご飯も、いい思い出になるよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we reel in something good, we could make a whole feast out of it. A delicious meal makes for great memories too, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様の料理なら、なんでもどこでも、ごちそうだわ。\n……あれ？\u3000あそこ見て",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Any meal you cook is a feast, no matter where we are. ...Hm? Look over there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "噂の真相を確かめる時が来たわ……\nさぁ、いつでもかかってらっしゃい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The time has come to uncover the truth of the rumor... Come on, then. I'm ready for anything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "調合した「パイ風撒き餌」もバッチリよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The 'pie-scented bait' I synthesized is all set."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふふ……必ず釣り上げてみせるわ、\nロロライナ・フリクセル……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe... I will catch you yet, Rorolina Frixell...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不審者がいるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's someone suspicious over there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シッ。見ちゃダメ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shh. Don't stare!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここらへんなら人も少なくて釣りしやすそう……あれ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There aren't many people around here, so it should be easy to fish... huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガじゃん！\nさっきヴァレリアとキューちゃんが探してたよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga! Valeria and Quinn were just looking for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "海を見ていたの？\u3000何か、いた？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Were you watching the sea? Did you see something out there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……否。ただいつものように\n危険な魔物がいないか海を見ていた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Negative. I was simply scanning the waters for dangerous creatures, as I always do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふーん。ヤドヴィガは、\nヴァレリアたちと一緒に遊びに行かないの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh. Aren't you going to go have fun with Valeria and the others?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "遊びに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Having fun..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私には、難しい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That is... difficult for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういうこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How do you mean?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この休暇は目的が不明確。\n私は何をするべきか、指示を待っている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This vacation lacks a clear objective. I am waiting for instructions on what I should be doing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あー……なるほどねぇ。ふんふん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahh... I see. Uh-huh, uh-huh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つまり、休暇の過ごし方が分からないと。\nこうやって行楽地に遊びに来るのは初めて？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you just don't know how to spend a vacation. Is this your first time coming somewhere like this for fun?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……肯定",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Affirmative."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふーむ、そっかそっか……よーし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, is that so... Alright then!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんじゃあ、アタシたちについてきな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come along with us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "休暇の楽しみ方、アタシが案内してあげる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll show you exactly how to enjoy a vacation!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]